rever they flank and fall back to <strong>/<em>/<del> only for spans markdown cannot express (bold tight against punctuation inside a word); the reader maps paired bare <strong>/<b>, <em>/<i>, <del>/<s>/<strike> back to styles. Atoms carry their own bold/italic/strike/link, typed literal markup stays literal, links keep their title and reference label, multi-line headings write setext, code fences grow past runs inside the code, and tables escape | outside code. A round-trip sweep of 65,536 styled run sequences reads back with every character's style intact; untouched documents still write byte-identical. Edited lists, quotes and alignment groups come next.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"eclipse-dirigible/dirigible","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T18:02:55Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"cf8e3797fea48e2cd91939a37a76e4c75a7dd557","github_link":"https://github.com/eclipse-dirigible/dirigible/commit/cf8e3797fea48e2cd91939a37a76e4c75a7dd557","commit_subject":"bpm: a .bpmn DELETE retires its deployments instead of cascading, the history level is explicit, and a record with a dangling process stamp is restartable (#7597, #7598, #7599) (#7601)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"eclipse-dirigible/dirigible","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T18:02:42Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"88d12478df7206e62088251cde220241dc39650a","github_link":"https://github.com/eclipse-dirigible/dirigible/commit/88d12478df7206e62088251cde220241dc39650a","commit_subject":"intent: visibleWhen - status-gated visibility for fields and detail panels (#7502) (#7566)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"dotnet/android","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T18:02:39Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"7ced344b42eb765a3900681bb32364b5c6f0fc67","github_link":"https://github.com/dotnet/android/commit/7ced344b42eb765a3900681bb32364b5c6f0fc67","commit_subject":"[androidsdk] Remove null suppression from SDK filtering (#12964)","ai_tool":"Copilot"},{"repo_name":"home-assistant/frontend","commit_timestamp":"2026-10-01T18